igure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\nH\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\n\\Longrightarrow\n(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\nH\\in\\mathcal{H}_{\\Box}\n\\Longrightarrow\n(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : 模态形式的Henkin句子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"728ff257684515d2\" href=\"?note=728ff257684515d2\" title=\"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal\">89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 可证性模态</li>\n<li>Henkin 句子在 GL 中与“自身可证”可证等价</li>\n<li>该等价不是公式的语法等号</li>\n<li>与Gödel句子形成对比</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$H$ : 模态形式